*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0010
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : M.S.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-04-15 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-10-01 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 451
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP090
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0010.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    *> ACCOUNT TYPE S=SAVINGS C=CHECKING P=PREMIUM G=GOLD B=BUSINESS F=FIXED
    05 ACCOUNT-TYPE       PIC X.
    *> AVERAGE MONTHLY BALANCE
    05 AVG-BALANCE        PIC 9(7)V99.
    05 RUN-DATE           PIC 9(8).
    05 RUN-DATE-R REDEFINES RUN-DATE.
       10 RUN-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 RUN-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 RUN-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(4).
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 WAIVE-IND          PIC X VALUE 'N'.
        88 WAIVE-WAIVED VALUE 'Y'.
    05 MTH-FEE            PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM MONTHLY-FEE-CHECK
    DISPLAY "WAIVE-IND=" WAIVE-IND
    DISPLAY "MTH-FEE=" MTH-FEE
    STOP RUN.
MONTHLY-FEE-CHECK.
    *> MONTHLY FEE WAIVER
    IF ACCOUNT-TYPE = 'G' OR 'P' OR AVG-BALANCE >= 2500
        SET WAIVE-WAIVED TO TRUE
        MOVE 0 TO MTH-FEE
    ELSE
        MOVE 5 TO MTH-FEE
    END-IF.
